    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84506.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 138,
    "turn_text": "All right, well, we'll see if we can fix that a little bit. But you released this policy proposal for what you want to do in Congress coming up, and we'll just kind of go point by point through this. One of the first things you have on here is you support term limits. What are your reasons for that?",
