      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that policy positions should be supported by articulated reasoning.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker sees the interlocutor as having legitimate authority or relevance to discuss congressional policy.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that term limits are a meaningful reform option within the current political framework.",
