    "turn_idx": 139,
    "turn_text": "Well, with Washington being broken, which is what I hear as I travel the States, that's what Nebraska are telling me that Washington is broken, and I agree with that. And many members of Congress seem to put their own interests first. And I think term limits would help to stop that. There's a lot of power in Washington. You know, we have career politicians in Congress. They've run up a $15",
