    "turn_idx": 144,
    "turn_text": "And I know with term limits, kind of the two arguments that are present for and against is, as you said, getting rid of the career politicians. But one of the arguments against it is the notion that there are a lot of people with, you know, the experience to be able to get things done, kind of understand the issues. How do you kind of balance those two things?",
