    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84506.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 153,
    "turn_text": "I think we need to look at what those benefits are that Congressmen receive. You know, it's supposed to be public servants. In Nebraska, we don't receive any health benefits, we don't have any retirement benefits, and we receive $12,000 a year. It's a public service to serve in the Nebraska legislature,",
