    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84506.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 156,
    "turn_text": "All right, and moving on to another point on your proposal is you've got proposing some pretty significant changes to the rules for lobbyists to help make them less influential in Congress if you could talk a little bit about those changes that you want to make to those rules.",
