  {
    "episode_id": 84506,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84506.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 157,
    "turn_text": "Yes, I'd be happy to. You know, I want to stop that revolving door for lobbyists. I think the American people are tired of politicians and staff members putting their career advancement over the interest of their constituents. First of all, suppose putting a lifetime ban on members of Congress from becoming federal law after they leave office. The big goes back to the thing you are running for the U.S. Senate, the reason you want to",
