  {
    "episode_id": 84506,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84506.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 159,
    "turn_text": "reason I want to serve is to be of service to the people and to try and accomplish things that will help Nebraskaans and help our country. Another point I have is I think we need to prevent family members of members of Congress from becoming lobbyists when they are serving in Congress. If I'm serving in Congress, my husband and my sons don't need to be there",
