    "turn_text": "Well, I think we need to put earmarks so we balance the budget. That's a way that we can do that. And also, we should require two-thirds majority before we pass any earmarks. We need to have discussions on a budget, and those discussions need to be open, they need to be honest, and we need to set the priorities of government. If as a United States",
